# fork-only pull requests

this repo is a fork. never open pull requests against the parent/upstream repository.

## repositories

| role | owner/repo |
|---|---|
| **fork (yours)** | `lassebenni/kahoot-alternative` |
| **parent (never PR here)** | `supabase-community/kahoot-alternative` |

## git remotes

- `origin` → `lassebenni/kahoot-alternative` (push branches and open PRs here)
- `upstream` → `supabase-community/kahoot-alternative` (read-only reference; do not PR)

## required behavior

- always create PRs with: `gh pr create --repo lassebenni/kahoot-alternative`
- before `gh pr create`, verify the base repo is the fork, not `supabase-community/*`
- never run `gh pr create` without `--repo` unless `gh repo set-default` is confirmed as `lassebenni/kahoot-alternative`
- never push feature branches to `upstream`
- production deploys come from merging to `main` on the fork (GitHub Actions → Cloudflare Pages)

## example

```bash
# ✅ correct
gh pr create --repo lassebenni/kahoot-alternative --base main --head feat/my-branch

# ❌ wrong — targets parent fork
gh pr create --repo supabase-community/kahoot-alternative
gh pr create   # when default repo is upstream
```
